Racy control for `pointer_read_target_object`: main reads slots[1]->next
holding mutex[1] while the thread writes it holding mutex[0]. The read goes
through the same `POINTER_OBJECT(p) == POINTER_OBJECT(&a)` chain. Must stay
FAILED before and after.
